me a father figure to her. When their secret was discovered, he sacrificed himself to buy her time to escape. She fled into the unknown, carrying nothing but the weapon he left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beginning of Fallen Valkyries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elara takes on dangerous quests to fund her ultimate goal, the formation of &quot;The Fallen Valkyries&quot; a resistance group dedicated to toppling the palace. However, her latest mission has taken an unexpected turn. The goblins she hunts are no longer the weak pests they once were. They have evolved, gaining immense strength and the ability to wield weapons. Trapped in a desperate struggle, Elara’s survival hangs in the balance. Will she make it out alive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q&amp;A</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why is the content so limited?</strong> It was a skill-building solo project made with a very tight budget and limited time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why not Early Access?</strong> We intended for this to be a short, simple game. The current version contains the entire experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will there be updates?</strong> Updates will be very rare and limited only to bug fixes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If it’s a prologue, why isn't it free?</strong> We originally intended for it to be free demo with a full game to follow. Unfortunately, the project was cut short due to a lack of development funds, and we are unable to continue production.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "An Anime Wave-based Arena Shooter, Kill Goblin &gt; Collect Bounty &gt; Buy Upgrade &gt; Survive", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009100/aa087afce9acdfa3c1fbdadda12b47162748336b/header.jpg?t=1776536041", "capsule_ima